      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The authors report a case of sacral osteosarcoma, which is a rare and dreaded tumor. Sciatica was the first manifestation. Patients with refractory sciatica and normal plain films and computed tomography studies of the lumbar spine should undergo magnetic resonance imaging to look for a sacral lesion."},
